{"id": "2811578", "name": "פתרון מד\"ר מסדר שני בטור חזקות – נוסחת נסיגה ומקדמים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המד\"ר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</p><p>נסמן פתרון שלה כטור חזקות:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(y(x)=\\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty} a_n x^n\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_0 ={{CT:1}},a_1=0\\)</span> מצאו \\(k\\) כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1=\\cdots=a_k=0\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_{k+1}\\neq 0\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">\\(k=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>חשבו את \\(a_{k+1}\\):</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">\\(a_{k+1}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_0 =0,a_1=1\\)</span> חשבו את \\(a_3\\):</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">\\(a_3= \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מציבים טור חזקות, מקבלים נוסחת נסיגה מהשוואת מקדמים, ומפעילים אותה על שני תנאי ההתחלה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הצבת הטור</b><br>זו מד\"ר לינארית מסדר שני עם מקדמים פולינומיים, ולכן יש לה פתרון בטור חזקות סביב 0. מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=\\sum a_nx^n\\)</span> ומשווים את המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^n\\)</span> לאפס:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (n+2)(n+1)\\,a_{n+2}+\\Big[\\big({{CT:2}}\\big)^{{{CT:3}}}y'\\Big]_{x^n}+{{CT:4}}\\,a_{n-{{CT:3}}}=0 \\]</p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_{n-{{CT:3}}}=0\\)</span> עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\lt {{CT:3}}\\)</span>. המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^n\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\big({{CT:2}}\\big)^{{{CT:3}}}y'\\)</span> תלוי רק ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1,\\dots,a_{n+1}\\)</span> (כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'=a_1+2a_2x+\\dots\\)</span>), ובפרט <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\big({{CT:2}}\\big)^{{{CT:3}}}={{CT:5}}+\\dots\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף א׳ — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_0={{CT:1}},\\ a_1=0\\)</span></b><br>באינדוקציה: אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1=\\dots=a_{n+1}=0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\lt {{CT:3}}\\)</span>, אז שני המחוברים האחרונים מתאפסים, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_{n+2}=0\\)</span>. כך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_1=a_2=\\dots=a_{{{CT:6}}}=0\\)</span>. עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:3}}\\)</span> נכנס לראשונה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\,a_0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:7}}\\,a_{{{CT:8}}}+{{CT:4}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad a_{{{CT:8}}}={{CT:9}}\\neq0 \\]</p>לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ k={{CT:10}},\\qquad a_{k+1}={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — סעיף ב׳ — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_0=0,\\ a_1=1\\)</span></b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n=0\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2a_2+\\left({{CT:11}}\\right)a_1=0\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a_2={{CT:12}}\\)</span>. עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n=1\\)</span> (המחובר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> עדיין לא משתתף, כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}>1\\)</span>): המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\big({{CT:2}}\\big)^{{{CT:3}}}y'\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left({{CT:11}}\\right)\\cdot 2a_2+\\left({{CT:13}}\\right)a_1\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 6a_3+\\left({{CT:11}}\\right)\\cdot2\\cdot\\left({{CT:12}}\\right)+\\left({{CT:13}}\\right)\\cdot1=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad a_3={{CT:14}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: is(ans1=kk) and is(ans2=akp1) and is(ans3=a3);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "a0", "a2v", "a3", "akp1", "b", "cs0", "cs1", "kk", "ode", "r", "s"], "nvariants": 50}